{"type":"standard","title":"Mankon language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mankon language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q6750551","titles":{"canonical":"Mankon_language","normalized":"Mankon language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mankon language</span></span>"},"pageid":35843889,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Togho_03.jpg/330px-Togho_03.jpg","width":330,"height":248},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Togho_03.jpg","width":2592,"height":1944},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1132966487","tid":"93f0c3f2-91c4-11ed-b8d9-1f0997705032","timestamp":"2023-01-11T15:28:20Z","description":"Grassfields language of Cameroon","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mankon_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mankon_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mankon_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mankon_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mankon_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Mankon_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mankon_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mankon_language"}},"extract":"Mankon is a Grassfields language spoken in Cameroon. It is closely related to Mundum and Mendankwe-Nkwen. Along with Mundum, it is called Ngemba. There are several distinct dialects: Mankunge (Ngemba), Nsongwa, Shomba, Mbutu (Bambutu), Njong (Banjong), Bagangu (Akum) and Alatening.","extract_html":"<p><b>Mankon</b> is a Grassfields language spoken in Cameroon. It is closely related to Mundum and Mendankwe-Nkwen. Along with Mundum, it is called <i>Ngemba</i>. There are several distinct dialects: Mankunge (Ngemba), Nsongwa, Shomba, Mbutu (Bambutu), Njong (Banjong), Bagangu (Akum) and Alatening.</p>"}